><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d2c/8394/3430_normal.png?m=1357958889\" alt=\"ahu\" data-uid=\"3430\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>48</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ahu\">ahu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 20:47:42 +08:00\">17h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不错，用上了。能不能缺省不翻译，由我手动开启翻译？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950694\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_normal.png?m=1786106139\" alt=\"dirstart\" data-uid=\"417579\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dirstart\">dirstart</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 20:52:34 +08:00\">17h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/vnues\">vnues</a> 我今天在做翻译插件的时候就发现了； github 很多技术词汇、button 、绿点 table 都比较特殊；<br>也许我该对 github 、hacknews 这种极客网站做特殊的适配 😏</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950706\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d2c/8394/3430_normal.png?m=1357958889\" alt=\"ahu\" data-uid=\"3430\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>51</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ahu\">ahu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 21:00:41 +08:00\">17h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>开启翻译和关闭翻译的快捷键最好是统一，按一下快捷键开启翻译，再按一下关闭这样子</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950707\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4061/ca6f/81262_normal.png?m=1780763512\" alt=\"hcwhan\" data-uid=\"81262\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>52</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hcwhan\">hcwhan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 21:01:05 +08:00\">17h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>希望增加 按住某快捷键 滑动选择一段文本后 自动弹出翻译窗口 功能</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950715\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b1b692feb18d86eb7534b7b355ea3d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"trumpmaga\" data-uid=\"613606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>54</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trumpmaga\">trumpmaga</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 21:08:42 +08:00\">17h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ahu\">ahu</a> 默认 Alt （ Option ）+S 就是翻译或恢复页面，你可以到快捷键里看下“翻译/恢复 页面”这个是否有值</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950720\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/59a7/45f2/171593_normal.png?m=1783688587\" alt=\"kiii\" data-uid=\"171593\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>56</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kiii\">kiii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 21:10:49 +08:00\">17h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用了，还行，没有按三次空格翻译的输入框，变成一个多余的按钮菜单。缺少单独的翻译框</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950729\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b1b692feb18d86eb7534b7b355ea3d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"trumpmaga\" data-uid=\"613606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>59</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trumpmaga\">trumpmaga</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 21:19:02 +08:00\">16h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Armor\">Armor</a> 你的意思是选中后立即就弹出翻译弹窗吗，当前支持选中后双击 Ctrl 弹出翻译弹窗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950766\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/713c/b677/317324_normal.png?m=1778243617\" alt=\"rpish\" data-uid=\"317324\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>60</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rpish\">rpish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 21:45:48 +08:00\">16h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Sh4wnny\">Sh4wnny</a> 感觉是好几个工具整合到一起了 网页翻译，视频翻译，漫画翻译 啥都有 但是配置菜单飞机仪表盘</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950821\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b1b692feb18d86eb7534b7b355ea3d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"trumpmaga\" data-uid=\"613606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>61</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trumpmaga\">trumpmaga</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 22:13:47 +08:00\">16h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/a566\">a566</a> 是问有没有其他视频平台的支持计划吗，Netflix 后续可能会支持</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950823\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a2db/faa6/457079_normal.png?m=1774178009\" alt=\"WayneCmd\" data-uid=\"457079\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>62</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/WayneCmd\">WayneCmd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 22:13:56 +08:00\">16h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>你这个对我来说赶得早不如赶得巧，刚刚用沉浸式翻译去翻一段句子，我用自己的本地服务都开始跟我要钱了，干完活马上就来找替代品了，我还没开始搜索，主页上就能看得到，真好！<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/3qCXutb.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3qCXutb.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>而且他这个很怪，只是翻个句子还必须要打开他这个网站，完了国内国外还是分开运营的 还不互通，难道是阿里腾讯华为退役下来的人做的？</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950833\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a5aa/a74a/663993_normal.png?m=1752757976\" alt=\"bowencool\" data-uid=\"663993\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>63</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bowencool\">bowencool</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 22:17:14 +08:00\">16h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为啥都不做油猴脚本呢？明明可以少装一个插件，脚本还能同步</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950835\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b1b692feb18d86eb7534b7b355ea3d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"trumpmaga\" data-uid=\"613606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>64</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trumpmaga\">trumpmaga</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 22:17:25 +08:00\">16h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/EricXuu\">EricXuu</a> 本来准备上的，但是发现速度有点慢，且容易报错 too many requests ，代码回退了，我后面再研究下吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950884\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/18fa/fc4d/355582_normal.png?m=1757299131\" alt=\"Yorkzhu\" data-uid=\"355582\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>65</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yorkzhu\">Yorkzhu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 22:50:59 +08:00\">15h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>支持手机上的 Edge 不？有时候手机端浏览也需要翻译</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950898\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6dd/9319/135441_normal.png?m=1774449914\" alt=\"imdoge\" data-uid=\"135441\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>66</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imdoge\">imdoge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 23:04:20 +08:00\">15h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>也是 GPL T_T ，我想给自己的侧边栏（形式和陪读蛙/沉浸翻译/楼主的不一样）加个翻译 skill ，但这些协议都让我不好抄算法……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17950958\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f1f/5433/109032_normal.png?m=1430280546\" alt=\"SadNoooo\" data-uid=\"109032\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>70</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SadNoooo\">SadNoooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-07 23:50:33 +08:00\">14h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>插个眼支持，希望有 Safari ～</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951023\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e049/fe8e/400212_normal.png?m=1782801747\" alt=\"milksofter\" data-uid=\"400212\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>73</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/milksofter\">milksofter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 00:45:42 +08:00\">13h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>和开源的 kiss-translator 相比，有什么特色吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951032\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e2db1e2f7c8ad293259d785380dec66c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"77158158\" data-uid=\"513678\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>74</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/77158158\">77158158</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 00:55:32 +08:00\">13h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个插件有些动态评论打开，也会自动翻译成功，这个蛮好的，其他一些插件，一些网址下面的评论展开的时候，就不会继续动态自动翻译，要重新按键才能翻译，这个翻译挺不错的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951044\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/91b2/4e78/217855_normal.png?m=1534296489\" alt=\"liuxyon\" data-uid=\"217855\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>75</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liuxyon\">liuxyon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 01:32:57 +08:00\">12h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不好用，刚测试翻译没有任何反映</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951142\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2d2c/8394/3430_normal.png?m=1357958889\" alt=\"ahu\" data-uid=\"3430\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>76</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ahu\">ahu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 08:03:02 +08:00\">6h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/bowencool\">bowencool</a> 刚刚去看 KISS 的 README ，看到的：</p><p>注：基于以下原因，建议优先使用浏览器扩展</p><p>浏览器扩展的功能更完整（本地语言识别、右键菜单等）<br>油猴脚本会遇到更多使用上的问题（跨域问题、脚本冲突等）</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951214\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e745/e1b7/458406_normal.png?m=1739337632\" alt=\"Rrrrrr\" data-uid=\"458406\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>77</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rrrrrr\">Rrrrrr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 09:18:26 +08:00\">5h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有一个不好的用户体验，我点了原生的字幕开关，你的插件应该跟它才对，一起开一起关。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951222\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1aea/7787/294351_normal.png?m=1714017470\" alt=\"MoGeJiEr\" data-uid=\"294351\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>78</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoGeJiEr\">MoGeJiEr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 09:27:38 +08:00\">4h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在用了大兄弟,第一观看还是比较好的,比较简洁</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951229\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1aea/7787/294351_normal.png?m=1714017470\" alt=\"MoGeJiEr\" data-uid=\"294351\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>79</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoGeJiEr\">MoGeJiEr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 09:31:44 +08:00\">4h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>希望添加支持连接谷歌云盘进行备份动功能.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951246\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4284/09de/544086_normal.png?m=1638415855\" alt=\"MCC12138\" data-uid=\"544086\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>80</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MCC12138\">MCC12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 09:38:44 +08:00\">4h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用了一下，非常简洁，要的就是简单的翻译功能，好东西</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951265\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b1b692feb18d86eb7534b7b355ea3d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"trumpmaga\" data-uid=\"613606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>83</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trumpmaga\">trumpmaga</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 09:57:52 +08:00\">4h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Armor\">Armor</a> 了解了，大部分翻译插件都有这个，个人感觉有点吵人就没加，打算加个开关支持这个功能。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951291\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b1b692feb18d86eb7534b7b355ea3d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"trumpmaga\" data-uid=\"613606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>86</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/trumpmaga\">trumpmaga</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 10:15:02 +08:00\">4h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Rrrrrr\">Rrrrrr</a> 感谢建议！这块加个设置项，插件字幕开关跟随 YouTube 原生字幕开关。另外问下你的建议：如果插件里关闭字幕开关，预期应该关闭 YouTube 原生字幕吗，个人倾向于不关闭</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951472\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8b2cc04c5b0a2b158f2a6bba4ac1d223?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"alading11\" data-uid=\"213226\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>89</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/alading11\">alading11</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 11:45:12 +08:00\">2h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在用了，很简洁。我最常用的是 youtube 的双语翻译，刚刚发现稍微有点奇怪的是双语字幕源语言貌似是根据节点来的，日本节点放英文视频双语显示的上面是日语下面是中文，是这样设置的吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951595\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/522e/8c12/524120_normal.png?m=1785115858\" alt=\"v2AKS\" data-uid=\"524120\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>91</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/v2AKS\">v2AKS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 13:09:59 +08:00\">1h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>下载了，支持！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951601\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/522e/8c12/524120_normal.png?m=1785115858\" alt=\"v2AKS\" data-uid=\"524120\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>92</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/v2AKS\">v2AKS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 13:13:36 +08:00\">1h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>另外询问一下哪个翻译服务质量比较好</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951608\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7b4910417986ae21be51460897b6b841?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JoeDH\" data-uid=\"645575\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>93</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JoeDH\">JoeDH</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 13:18:45 +08:00\">1h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>赞一个，很不错，翻译速度很快！</p><p>你这个翻译速度真的很不错，速度真的是一个非常非常重要的点。对比另一个开源陪读娃，我特别不喜欢它的翻译速度，永远都比不过沉浸式，估计这也是很多人离不开沉浸式的一个点。</p><p>另外我没发现有关闭双语对照的开关，面板那个只是双语高亮吧？希望可以加个只展示译文的</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951675\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e63a2d5a663aa0b641548facf9e23fed?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yangyingchao\" data-uid=\"523739\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>94</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yangyingchao\">yangyingchao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 14:03:16 +08:00\">15 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>chrome 浏览器，浏览 reddit 页面时候网页会闪烁，不停的自动显示翻译过的文字，然后再自动关闭，再显示，如此往复。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"特点：完全免费、开箱即用、没有登录注册、没有营销弹窗。 截图 本次更新主要功能 微软翻译接口失效修复 YouTube 双语字幕 引入更加可定制化的网站翻译规则系统 (控制翻译和不翻译区域, 提升阅读体验) 常用翻译场景均已覆盖，chrome 插件地址直达，更多功能介绍请访问github和官网。 三大浏览器商店均已上架，欢迎大家尝试和提意见。 碎碎念: 1 、最近（ 8 月 4 日）微软翻译接口调整，导致大部分插件微软翻译都失效了，感觉应该当天就先发布一个最小修复版本（那天卸载量 40 ，当天发布应该数据就打正了😢）。主要由于新增的功能还有很多问题需要解决，就拖到昨天才提交商店审核，今天通过。 2 、目前 chrome 商店已突破 400 用户。edge 还是 300 多一直没怎么变，也没有评论和反馈。推广和增长是真的难啊。 3 、本次更新商店审核速度：Firefox 立即通过(应该都是直接通过, 后续可能审核)、Edge 当天通过（这次很快）、Chrome 第二天通过。 翻译 开源 插件94 replies • 2026-08-08 14:03:16 +08:00 1 vnues 22h 39m ago 你双语对照怎么搞的 我看 github 双语对照 界面有点丑 2 Sh4wnny 22h 35m ago 1 沉浸式翻译现在是真的臃肿... 一直在用但是越来越感觉眼花缭乱了 10 tim9527 22h 13m ago 在用了 确实效果不错，搭配梁圣的 deepseke 美滋滋 11 ffalex 22h 10m ago via Android 试试，一直在用 kiss 12 mosfet 22h 10m ago 相对陪读蛙感觉没啥优势啊我也只用他的“多接口文本翻译”，用不同的模型翻译比对，选一个看着顺眼的 13 xy19009188 22h 4m ago 我给你增加一个 edge 用户，一直在用 kiss 那个，看看哪个好看点 14 trumpmaga OP 21h 59m ago @mosfet 这类插件本来就多。我主要自己就是重度用户，有问题及时解决，最起码项目不会黄。另外我想要的双语逐句对照功能，别的插件都没有，只能自己开发了。 17 GeekSuPro 21h 54m ago Firefox 下使用微软服务正常，使用 StepPlan 的 api 测试成功，实际翻译页面报错：网页翻译失败JSON.parse: unexpected character at line 1 column 1 of the JSON data还是要给你点个赞 19 JYii 21h 38m ago 已试用，暂时觉得不错 20 likeme 21h 37m ago 可以，ui 挺好看 24 jianny 21h 31m ago 上次发布后就一直在用了，翻译速度非常快 26 lizhenda 21h 12m ago 抄一下 沉浸式翻译 的悬浮球自动贴边收起的样式？现在这个滑动按钮太奇怪了吧 。。。 29 NickyPP 20h 54m ago 挺不错的，先主力用了，而且喜欢这种专一简洁的软件，希望以后不会太臃肿 30 xinyana 20h 18m ago via Android 我一直觉得豆包插件已经很极致了 33 tuot 19h 41m ago 不错耶，下载支持，希望一直是简洁好用 34 imqiyue 19h 30m ago via iPhone 不错，沉浸式翻译太臃肿了 35 24 19h 28m ago 蹲一手 safari 插件 36 seven777 18h 42m ago @seven777 #32 我试用了,非常不错!!!轻量,简洁.说实话,我有付费的欲望.另外:划词翻译,划词弹出按钮还是要有的吧? 40 Armor 18h 17m ago 刚下载就删了，悬浮一个绿色点，一个橙色开关，有点乱，我还是习惯划词翻译 41 yeeyeung 18h 16m ago 也从 kiss 换过来试试看。我看 kiss 有调用 build in AI 接口，可以的话也请加入吧～ 42 trumpmaga OP 18h 4m ago @Armor 两个都可以很方便的永久禁用，悬浮球下个版本不再使用胶囊，改成自动贴边收起的类型 43 Pinkmemory 18h 3m ago 试用了下确实简洁，希望能一直保持。safari 版本希望能早日上架~ 45 EricXuu 17h 57m ago 期待支持 deeplx 的接口 46 Armor 17h 55m ago @trumpmaga #42 能否出个，选中，然后翻译这段话这样的，我习惯这样操作，我个人小建议 🐶 47 a566 17h 36m ago 会只翻译 youtube 视频吗 48 ahu 17h 31m ago 不错，用上了。能不能缺省不翻译，由我手动开启翻译？ 50 dirstart 